{"ts": "2026-10-31T04:05:16.125330Z", "run_id": "r-20261031T0339Z-c380", "unit": "openspec:add-admin-api", "seq": 78, "type": "delegate.result", "question": "Q-002", "id": "Q-002", "status": "answered", "reason": "Verified in the frozen test that carol is signed in at line 180 via the signIn helper, which calls upsertUserFromClaims; verified in src/identity/users.ts:119-121 that this inserts an idp_link row for the new subject. The stored query at lines 263-269 has no user filter, so sub-carol is necessarily present. design.md decision 10 says there is no unlink, so no correct implementation can satisfy the current assertion. Option 1 changes only the expected array and keeps the scenario's intent (no refused pair stored, no audit event).", "called": true, "tasks": ["3.1"], "target": null, "kind": "technical", "profile": "delegate-fable", "model": "claude-fable-5-1", "cli": "claude-code", "cost_usd": 0.9322237500000001, "decision": "accept", "answer_sha256": "2c41ee3e0b8a1591a9f7b878812a5c36bc5297b25fd7c918b6afa813215d5791", "checked": [{"ref": "src/identity/admin/idp-links.test.ts:180", "quote": "const carol = await signIn(db, a, \"sub-carol\", T08, ids);", "claim": "The test signs carol in with subject sub-carol in tenant A before the refusal cases."}, {"ref": "src/identity/admin/idp-links.test.ts:48", "quote": "upsertUserFromClaims(tx, ctx, { issuer: ISS, subject, name: subject.slice(4) }, {", "claim": "The signIn helper creates the user through upsertUserFromClaims with the routed issuer and the given subject."}, {"ref": "src/identity/users.ts:120", "quote": "INSERT INTO ursitoare.idp_link (tenant_id, issuer, subject, user_id, linked_at) VALUES ($1, $2, $3, $4, $5)", "claim": "upsertUserFromClaims inserts an idp_link row for every first sign-in, so carol's sign-in stores subject sub-carol."}, {"ref": "src/identity/admin/idp-links.test.ts:265", "quote": "SELECT subject FROM ursitoare.idp_link WHERE tenant_id = $1 ORDER BY subject", "claim": "The stored query selects every idp_link subject of the tenant with no user filter, so sub-carol is included."}, {"ref": "src/identity/admin/idp-links.test.ts:270", "quote": "assert.deepEqual(stored, [\"sub-ann\", \"sub-bob\"], \"nothing was linked\");", "claim": "The assertion omits sub-carol and therefore cannot pass with a correct insert-only addIdpLink."}, {"ref": "spec:design.md", "quote": "There is no unlink.", "claim": "The design forbids removing IdP links, so no implementation may delete carol's sign-in link to satisfy the current assertion."}]}
